1
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:06,617
I was in community college
when I first crossed

2
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,759
paths with that buzzkill
of a man I call my husband.

3
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:14,344
It turned out he went to one of
the ritzier colleges in the area.

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:18,859
My friends at the time thought he
was dreamy and fawned over the guy.

5
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:23,620
The fact that I was the girl on his
arm made me feel a bit superior.

6
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,097
Then we had a kid.

7
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:36,237
I get it because it's three
times faster. The picture.

8
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:39,717
Oh come on. Hayato.

9
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:40,897
At least say hi.

10
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,317
Hi mom.

11
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:49,217
It's not that my husband's a bad person.

12
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,320
He's not even a heavy.

13
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,750
drinker.

14
00:00:52,833 --> 00:00:56,557
And he might not bring home a big
paycheck, but he's a damn hard worker.

15
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,470
Even

16
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:03,397
so, I fell into a marriage
without ever knowing love.

17
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,160
So he's finally home.

18
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,760
All I ever hear

19
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:10,197
is where's dinner, make me
a bath, I'm going to bed.

20
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:11,460
Jeez, what a bore.

21
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:22,150
I'm home.

22
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,042
Where's dinner?

23
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:30,900
Oh, hey, you're finally home.

24
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:32,817
I didn't even hear you open the door.

25
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:34,840
Sorry, I was too busy to cook.

26
00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:36,137
That'll have to do.

27
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:38,161
But your favorite's on the table.

28
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,637
I bet he's pissed.

29
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:45,417
Let's see if he's man enough
to do something about it.

30
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:46,500
Who am I kidding?

31
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:50,875
You're gonna sit there stuffing your
face in silence like you always do.

32
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:55,990
Radio.

33
00:01:56,780 --> 00:01:57,820
Good evening.

34
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:00,060
This is Mariah Radio.

35
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:03,037
Kai Howard here, your neighborhood
purveyor of good lives.

36
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,717
Hey, what you doing over there?

37
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:06,859
How is everyone on this fine night?

38
00:02:06,980 --> 00:02:07,810
Great, I hope.

39
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:10,720
Allow me to ease you
into a mellow journey.

40
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:16,389
We found his house about 15
minutes away from Mariah Station.

41
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:20,114
It was in a part of town known
for its views and villas.

42
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:25,480
Actually, it was his former house,
where he lived as Yoshikage Kira.

43
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:29,860
Now he has a new face, a new job,

44
00:02:30,060 --> 00:02:33,820
