probably even a new family.

45
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:37,977
It's obvious that he's
never turning up here again,

46
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:41,178
but just the same, we still
have to search the place.

47
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:45,877
If we're going to find any clues as
to where this new man ran off to,

48
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:48,901
we're going to find them
right here in this house.

49
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:58,017
Huh given how much that kid looks
like our guy this must be his album

50
00:02:58,100 --> 00:03:01,397
Yoshikage Kira he was born in Mariah

51
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:05,557
on January 30th 1966 he's nearly two

52
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:11,277
meters tall he weighs 65 kilograms
and his blood type is A he was born

53
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:16,460
to older parents when he was 21 his
father Yoshihiro fell ill and died

54
00:03:17,140 --> 00:03:19,081
Seems his mother died soon after.

55
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:23,120
Graduated in 1988 with
a degree in literature.

56
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:30,140
Same year, he starts at Kameyu in S-City,
and in 1993 transfers to the Mariah branch.

57
00:03:30,820 --> 00:03:32,920
He has no previous criminal record,

58
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:35,697
