close friends or lover.

59
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:37,545
He's never even had a surgery.

60
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:41,697
And we can't find him with fingerprints,
dental records, or surgical scars.

61
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:44,857
So what you're trying to say
is we've reached a dead end.

62
00:03:44,940 --> 00:03:45,770
Check it out.

63
00:03:45,853 --> 00:03:48,877
The trophies and plaques
they all say third

64
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:51,860
place so he certainly
wasn't a star athlete.

65
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:56,577
Nothing speaks to his
talents was it sports music

66
00:03:56,660 --> 00:04:00,377
writing even here he's
trying not to stand out.

67
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:03,637
He's never been the
object of ridicule or envy

68
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:06,277
and he never reveals his
strengths or weaknesses

69
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:09,877
