71
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:16,805
He knew laying low would be the
best way to stay out of trouble.

72
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:20,714
My hope in coming here was
to find hobbies or interests.

73
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:22,349
Any clue in the slightest.

74
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:23,850
Hobbies?

75
00:04:23,933 --> 00:04:24,955
I may have found one.

76
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:29,880
For some weird reason, he keeps a
bunch of jars in this drawer. You see?

77
00:04:31,780 --> 00:04:35,368
If you ask me, this looks like
a collection of bonito flakes.

78
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:37,286
But what is with the numbers?

79
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:39,690
1983. Hmm.

80
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:41,100
Must be the year.

81
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:47,600
Pee-yew, they smell rancid. What are they?

82
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,939
Seems they're fingernail clippings.

83
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:56,860
Whose nails do you
think they are? Hold on.

84
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,350
Calm down.

85
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,837
They're not from his victims.

86
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,567
Those clippings are his own.

87
00:05:01,740 --> 00:05:04,093
