was 31 and a half centimeters long!

96
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,310
Wait a sec!

97
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:26,147
I'm pretty sure 1983 was the
year Reimi Sugimoto was murdered!

98
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:28,697
Yeah, and the records begin in that year.

99
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:30,677
He probably reached a
point where he couldn't

100
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:33,231
repress his murderous impulses any longer.

101
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:34,910
Whoa!

102
00:05:34,993 --> 00:05:37,117
This is all the info he
collected about his toenails!

103
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:41,200
A boring office worker seems to
have a very interesting hobby.

104
00:05:41,780 --> 00:05:42,610
Look.

105
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:47,080
This is a form of divination.

106
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,697
It's similar to ancient
Jewish merchants who once

107
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:52,604
observed sunspots to
predict economic prospects.

108
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:55,657
It appears Yoshikage
Kira is tying his nail

109
00:05:55,740 --> 00:05:58,357
growth to his physical
and mental preparedness.

110
00:05:58,440 --> 00:06:00,800
His preparedness to kill, that is.

111
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,340
Check out 1999!

112
00:06:03,940 --> 00:06:07,437
By June of this year, they'd
already grown over 20 centimeters!

113
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:10,080
I knew he was crazy, but this is sick.

114
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:13,477
I agree with you, but this
won't help us track him down.

115
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,972
There might be something else we can use.

116
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,440
What the hell, Jotaro?

117
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:26,177
You think someone's skulking
around the house under our noses?

118
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:27,280
Seems that way.

119
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,960
Josuke, stay on guard.

120
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:31,337
Could he have been maybe
working with a partner?

121
