of spiritual limbo between the
land of the living and the dead.

137
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,457
Look at his expression.

138
00:07:16,540 --> 00:07:19,305
It seems like he wants
us to make a quick exit.

139
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:28,697
Hey, are you trying to give us the
willies with your spooky ghost energy?

140
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:32,677
This sucks, but we can't leave with
all this paranormal shit going on.

141
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,584
Answer the damn phone, slacker!

142
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:36,389
Can't you hear me calling?

143
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:45,020
