leave this house alive!

147
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:55,800
I'll kill you for going
after my son! Oh, fart!

148
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:58,657
Do you know about all the
crimes your son has committed?

149
00:07:58,740 --> 00:08:01,177
Hey, you guys, what's with
all the racket in here?

150
00:08:01,260 --> 00:08:02,377
Is something wrong?

151
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:04,177
Where the hell are you hiding?

152
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:06,277
Show yourself your geriatric ghost.

153
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,380
There's a ghost

154
00:08:10,540 --> 00:08:12,952
Josuke, I don't think he's hiding at all.

155
00:08:13,660 --> 00:08:18,520
Kira's father has been in the room
the entire time watching us you see.

156
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:24,717
When the hell did he he's able
to move around in the picture?

157
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:28,157
So it stands to reason he made
the call from in there and

158
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:31,652
he threw the phone at you from
inside the picture as well.

159
00:08:32,540 --> 00:08:34,440
I'll kill you!

160
00:08:35,620 --> 00:08:39,280
If you dare go after my dearest son,

161
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:42,400
I'll murder you!

162
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,320
Hey, Josuke!

163
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:48,492
Even if we can't physically
fight a ghost, our stance can!

164
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:53,057
On the day we met Reimi, Rohan sensei
used Tevin's door to read her memories!

165
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:54,060
Good to know!

166
00:08:54,540 --> 00:08:56,040
How do you like this?

167
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:01,750
What?

168
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,310
Damage!

169
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:10,737
Damage inflicted on the
photograph backfires to us!

170
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:13,702
Fix it now, Josuke, or
we'll be ripped to shreds!

171
00:09:19,340 --> 00:09:21,757
Thank goodness, you
guys are back to normal!

172
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,720
Those powers!

173
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,117
Yes, it's all making sense!

174
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:28,440
You whelps have special
abilities, like my son's!

175
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,430
Okuyasu!

176
00:09:30,513 --> 00:09:32,057
It's time for you to do your thing!

177
00:09:32,140 --> 00:09:37,081
You have to hurry up and use the hand to
cut this crusty old man out of the picture!

178
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,270
Gotcha!

179
00:09:38,353 --> 00:09:40,908
You just leave everything
to me, Chillscape!

180
00:09:46,940 --> 00:09:47,770
Okuyasu!

181
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:49,513
What the hell happened?

182
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:52,217
How'd I run straight into the window?

183
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:53,241
That's so weird!

184
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,360
What the heck?

185
00:09:57,540 --> 00:09:58,937
Do you guys see my hands?

186
00:09:59,020 --> 00:09:59,997
They're over there!

187
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:03,177
