coming into the room with you!

188
00:10:03,260 --> 00:10:04,090
Huh?

189
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,080
What in the hell?

190
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:12,997
I don't know how, but there's an invisible
wall blocking anyone from entering!

191
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:15,420
And I don't think I can break it! Shit!

192
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:18,120
I see you finally figured it out.

193
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,837
This photo is special.

194
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,077
The invisible wall that
you're so worked up

195
